## Named Evidence Gaps

- Current MWAA Design Manual (2020, plus any 2021–2025 addenda) sections on acoustics, PA zoning, EVACS, FIDS, and tenant technology standards. Not retrieved in this pass; must be pulled from MWAA's engineering portal.
- Specific MII thresholds and project-approval categories under the 2025 U&L.
- Current TSA guidance on required non-emergency terminal security announcements (frequency, wording, multilingual coverage).
- Executed acoustic performance of existing IAD and DCA terminal spaces (measured ambient dBA, reverberation time, STI). No public measurement on record.

None of these should be inferred; each is a call for primary-source retrieval before publication.
